<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 150 mln Swiss franc 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 150 mln Swiss franc 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.50 PCT  MATURITY    06.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.70    PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTE  *WITH REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    EBS	 S&amp;P	  AA</p>
<p> NOTES	SUBSCRIPTIONS CLOSE 18.OCT.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
